      "voiceId": "bill-maher",
      "voiceName": "Bill Maher",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": ".@JohnFetterman this week at @ClubRandom_!\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/billmaher/status/2054586457420112155",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-13T15:35:58+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "bill-maher",
      "voiceName": "Bill Maher",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "There's a new breed of content-creator assassins, and these are not your father's political assassins.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/billmaher/status/2052948164408180780",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-09T03:05:58+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "bill-maher",
      "voiceName": "Bill Maher",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "There are now 1,800 ships awaiting passage through the Strait of Hormuz. The last person who needed this many escorts was Hunter Biden.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/billmaher/status/2052947918286418240",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-09T03:05:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "bill-maher",
      "voiceName": "Bill Maher",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Every time I think this country is too woke, I look at what's going on in Britain, and it puts it in perspective. #RTOvertime\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/billmaher/status/2052444212789117271",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-07T17:43:27+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "bill-maher",
      "voiceName": "Bill Maher",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": ".@DrDebraSoh this week at @ClubRandom_!\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/billmaher/status/2051302483780374764",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-04T14:06:38+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "bill-maher",
      "voiceName": "Bill Maher",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I don't need to chase every one of your manufactured buzzwords down the rabbit hole.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/billmaher/status/2050413159949672872",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-02T03:12:46+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "bill-maher",
      "voiceName": "Bill Maher",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I am not surprised the attempt failed, because take it from a comedian, no one ever kills at the White House Correspondents' Dinner.\n\nVideo",
